# OPEN-WEBUI-COMMS-AUTH Stage 2 (Architect 2026-06-02 11:14 PDT):
# Vite local-overlay env files MUST stay out of the repo — operators put
# VITE_WS_TOKEN into .env.production.local so the secret value never lands in
# a tracked file. The committed .env.production carries the variable wiring
# only, never the value.
.env.local
.env.*.local

